<title>SINGAPORE: Datapulse shareholder sells 10 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Datapulse shareholder sells 10 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Datapulse Technology Ltd said on Tuesday director Ng Khim Guan had sold 10 million shares in the company at Singapore $0.72 each.</p>
<p>The sale reduced Ng's stake in Datapulse to 40.4 million shares, or 22.44 percent of its issued share capital, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Datapulse shares ended half a cent firmer at S$0.74 with over 10.6 million shares traded.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
